%I A395249 #61 Aug 24 2026 18:48:50
%S A395249 20,13,41,29,61,145,785,773,761,4877,33517,33505,33493
%N A395249 a(n) is the least number m such that m + 12*j is a sum of two distinct nonzero nonunit squares for all j from 0 to n-1, but m + 12*n is not, or -1 if no such number exists.
%C A395249 After r=1 and r=4, r=12 sets a new length record: m+r*j is representable as a sum of two distinct nonzero nonunit squares from j = 0 to n-1, whereas m+r*n is not.
%C A395249 a(14), if it exists, exceeds 10^9.
%e A395249 a(2) = 13, because 13 = 2^2 + 3^2; 25 = 3^2 + 4^2; 37 is not a sum of 2 distinct squares > 2; and no lesser number has this property.
%e A395249 a(13) = 33493, because 33493 = 2^2 + 183^2; 33505 = 4^2 + 183^2; 33517 = 99^2 + 154^2; 33529 = 60^2 + 173^2; 33541 = 54^2 + 175^2; 33553 = 8^2 + 183^2; 33565 = 21^2 + 182^2; 33577 = 51^2 + 176^2; 33589 = 10^2 + 183^2; 33601 = 124^2 + 135^2; 33613 = 93^2 + 158^2; 33625 = 35^2 + 180^2; 33637 = 111^2 + 146^2; 33649 is not a sum of 2 distinct squares > 2; and no lesser number has this property.
%o A395249 (PARI) is_sum2c(n)=my(m=factor(n),f=m~[1,],g=m~[2,]);for(i=1,#f,my(p=f[i],k=g[i]);if(p%4==3&&k%2==1,return(0)));1
%o A395249 exist(m)=if(!is_sum2c(m), return(0));my(r = sqrtint(m));for(x = 2, r,my(y2 = m - x^2);my(y = sqrtint(y2));if(x!=y && y > 1 && y^2 == y2,return(1)));0
%o A395249 card(m)=my(n=0,v);while(exist(m+12*n)!=0,n++);n
%o A395249 a(n)=for(m=3,+oo,my(c=card(m));if(c==n,return(m)));-1
%Y A395249 Cf. A000290, A085989, A025426, A168559, A355769, A397416.
%K A395249 nonn,more,new
%O A395249 1,1
%A A395249 _Jean-Marc Rebert_, Jul 12 2026
